      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLASHY PHIL (8) proved too good on debut over 305m at this track to score by 0.8 lengths (18.21). Drawn wide but has good early pace. Rates a top chance again. WHERE'S MICK (1) is having his first start around this track. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 6 lengths (22.60) at Warrnambool. Won at his only start from this box. Worth following up. HUXES UNCLE (2) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when second (19.94) at Angle Park and may be close to breaking through. Will give a great sight again. PRETTY ESMAY (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 6 at this track over 305m.",
